{title: If Thou But Suffer God to Guide Thee}
{artist: Georg Neumark · tr. Catherine Winkworth}
{key: Dm}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
If [Dm]thou but suffer [Gm]God to [A]guide thee and [Dm]hope in [Gm]him through [A]all thy ways,
he'll [Dm]give thee strength, what[Gm]e'er be[A]tide thee, and [Dm]bear thee [A]through the [Dm]evil days:
who [F]trusts in God's un[C]changing [F]love builds [Dm]on the rock that [A]naught can [Dm]move.
